  },
  "runs": [
    {
      "run_id": 40872772028,
      "code": "88a7484",
      "result": "every one of the 72 calls was cut off at the 128-token output limit (LengthFinishReasonError, completion_tokens=128): a reasoning model counts its reasoning toward that limit, so no verdict was produced. Cost not recorded by the runner (rows carry cost_usd null); from the usage in the errors about 72 x (640 in + 128 out) tokens."
    },
    {
      "run_id": 40873893367,
      "code": "1c14c66",
      "result": "output limit 256 with minimal reasoning: 55 calls completed, 17 failed with HTTP 429 'You have no credits remaining' from the OpenAI account (not this repository's ceiling, which was 0.10 USD and 0.0114 USD was spent)."
    },
    {
      "run_id": 41028410426,
      "code": "6136313",
      "result": "ceiling typed as 0.05 USD after the account was topped up: 33 calls were made ($0.0068355) and 39 were never sent, because the runner reserves the worst-case cost of every call before making it and the reservations of 34 calls already used the ceiling ('experiment budget exhausted before request'). Not a failure of the model or the account; the run is not counted as a measurement."
    },
    {
      "run_id": 41028746613,
      "code": "6136313",
      "result": "ceiling 0.20 USD: all 72 calls were made and none failed ($0.01485675 in model rows). The step that printed the report dumped the cases first, so its metrics could not be read from the log (the artifact host is not reachable from the session) and this run was not used for the numbers."
    },
    {
